<p class="s51">Hang-glider</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border-width: 1px; border-color: #000000; padding: 3px;">
<p class="s51">Dirigeable</p>
</td>
<td style="border-width: 1px; border-color: #000000; padding: 3px;">
<p class="s51">Airship, dirigible (us)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
